%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 9: where is Grandpa?
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 109 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/fog cb-light
220 cb-harbour-sky
-9 700 60 150 cb-pier
0 600 0.7 cb-fog
