newpath 470 470 moveto 640 470 lineto cb-wood-c cb-rgb << /Width 8 /Pressure { pop 1 } >> pkribbon
/cb-lit false def 500 466 50 cb-lantern
-260 60 640 cb-mama
/cb-worry true def 150 60 380 cb-ana /cb-worry false def
cb-ink cb-rgb
(The fog swallows the boats. It swallows the pier. \252Where is Grandpa?\272 Ana whispers.) 56 584 500 /center cb-text pop
9 cb-folio
showpage
